# bulky per-run workdirs (fake-home, scratch data trees) stay local;
# the committed evidence set is BASELINE.full.json + run_full.out +
# evidence/.  Smoke-profile outputs are transient re-run artifacts
# (a smoke re-run must leave the tree clean):
run-*/
bootprobe/
run_smoke.log
run_smoke.out
BASELINE.smoke.json
